Blocked span marker renders as empty cell

```
| A | B | C |
|---|---|---|
| x | y | z |
| ^ | < | d |
.
<table>
  <thead>
    <tr><th scope="col">A</th><th scope="col">B</th><th scope="col">C</th></tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td rowspan="2">x</td><td>y</td><td>z</td></tr>
    <tr><td></td><td>d</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
```
